{"steam_appid":2698940,"steam_name":"The Crew Motorfest","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2698940/1890708269/0fa50dcf57b79ecd19f67d52dfd336784c9030cc/1791214618/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791363869","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257372506/1ae3c8f1bcb725522e57a05666d7d08c4e070f99/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791363869","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/ss_933b5c1de0571f4e0c26c39ca3a4f68a314b2e38.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791551745","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/404d4a443efc6ff31eab3902e932f836ee83ec94/ss_404d4a443efc6ff31eab3902e932f836ee83ec94.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791551745","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/9a2fa8f4677c72372031f31a53aa03ed4e2b56ac/ss_9a2fa8f4677c72372031f31a53aa03ed4e2b56ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791551745","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/737e29396443e6823bb281a4865a3a4fcd4febba/ss_737e29396443e6823bb281a4865a3a4fcd4febba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791551745","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/ss_d88a7b6cf59355545b0a90a8254379edd423cc06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791551745"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game free for 5 hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your ticket to Motorfest, show off your skills, and live the most thrilling driving experiences car culture has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/5f60533eb167fab542decde0589dfb62.avif?t=1791551745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras_big/5f60533eb167fab542decde0589dfb62.webp?t=1791551745 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/9af535f39ee2333f3f5da857fb3cdc7a.poster.avif?t=1791551745\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/9af535f39ee2333f3f5da857fb3cdc7a.webm?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/9af535f39ee2333f3f5da857fb3cdc7a.mp4?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the playlists and dive into thematic campaigns that will immerse you in the most exciting car culture universes, including American muscle, Japanese-style street racing, and legendary machines of the past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/0115c82de51322915d55269bad20f12f.avif?t=1791551745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras_big/0115c82de51322915d55269bad20f12f.webp?t=1791551745 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/3fcbd53f07c393791e5db91ae7d9ef7f.poster.avif?t=1791551745\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/3fcbd53f07c393791e5db91ae7d9ef7f.webm?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/3fcbd53f07c393791e5db91ae7d9ef7f.mp4?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master every driving challenge and fill your collection with the most legendary vehicles ever created. Customize your cars and show off your own style with the custom contest mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/aeec4de92e1554cf0eb94f5c27e4291f.avif?t=1791551745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras_big/aeec4de92e1554cf0eb94f5c27e4291f.webp?t=1791551745 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/1da54478b0920d91039035f74b9d9be3.poster.avif?t=1791551745\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/1da54478b0920d91039035f74b9d9be3.webm?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/1da54478b0920d91039035f74b9d9be3.mp4?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crew Motorfest has settled down in one of the most breathtaking places on Earth: the island of O'ahu, Hawaii. Join high-speed street races through the bustling city of Honolulu, test your off-road skills on the ashy slopes of a volcano, and master the perfect curve on the tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/92fe012fa6a1245c8524fb821f10c0ae.avif?t=1791551745\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras_big/92fe012fa6a1245c8524fb821f10c0ae.webp?t=1791551745 width=1560 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/059a6a7af610c62095953630c4a39b22.poster.avif?t=1791551745\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/059a6a7af610c62095953630c4a39b22.webm?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698940/extras/059a6a7af610c62095953630c4a39b22.mp4?t=1791551745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master all types of vehicles in the Grand Race and finish first among 28 other drivers. Jump into the pure mayhem of Demolition Royale where eight teams battle to be the last one standing. Take on the Summit Contest by completing challenges to dominate the leaderboards!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460, AMD Ryzen5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 480 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-8400, AMD Ryzen7 2700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 6GB  or AMD Radeon RX 5700XT 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Racing"],"developers":["Ubisoft Ivory Tower"],"publishers":["Ubisoft"],"release_date":"18 Apr, 2024"}